## UI Rules

- iMessage-style bubbles: sender messages right-aligned with blue background, recipient messages left-aligned with gray background
- Use the `chat-interface` component from @tonyzebastian for the thread shell
- Use `advanced-ai-chat-input` from @ravikatiyar162 for the compose bar — the "AI check" button lives here
- Use the option-picker pattern from `ai-chat` by @beratberkayg for displaying the 3 rewrite options
- The 3 rewrite option cards must also include a "send as-is" button and an inline edit option
- Timestamps on every message bubble
- Empty state on `/chats`: centered text "Start a conversation" — no illustration needed for v1

