- `feat: conversation list`
- `feat: thread view + realtime`
- `feat: ai compose layer`
- `feat: contact profile + rules`
- `fix: e2e test fixes`
- `feat: pwa manifest + deploy`

No squash commits. One commit per step so rollbacks are clean.

